  "worked_solution": "If the ratio of vanilla flavored cakes to total cakes is $5:9,$ it means that there are $5$ vanilla flavored cakes for every $9$ cakes in total.\n\nAnother way of writing this is to say that \"out of every $9$ cakes in the bakery, $5$ of them are vanilla flavored cakes.\"",
